  steps:
    1. Choose grid 30x30, pick 2-4 rectangle specs (height 4-7, width 5-10), each with a distinct color from {1,2,3,6,8}.
    2. Place rectangles on the grid with >=2-cell margin from edges, ensuring no overlap.
